    featuredImagePrompt: "A panoramic, realistic view of a vast, parched landscape under a hazy, orange-tinged sky, indicative of extreme heat and distant wildfires. In the foreground, subtle advanced technology elements are visible: a sleek, solar-powered drone with an integrated sensor array hovers discreetly, observing the environment. In the far distance, faint plumes of smoke rise against a menacing sky. The scene should convey both the devastating impact of climate change and the quiet, vigilant presence of technological intervention. Emphasize the dry, cracked earth and stressed vegetation. Capture a sense of urgency and scale. Focus on a wide-angle scene with high realism and natural light.",
