    featuredImagePrompt: "A conceptual visual representing the complex state of the cryptocurrency market. On one side, a clear, flowing stream of digital currency (Bitcoin symbols) pouring into a stylized institutional vault, symbolizing ETF inflows. On the other side, a fragmented, crumbling digital landscape with broken blockchain links and faded project logos, depicting the market shakeout. In the background, a large, opaque legislative document with a \'DELAYED\' stamp, symbolizing regulatory uncertainty. Use a blend of futuristic digital aesthetics and abstract financial metaphors. The mood should be dynamic yet uncertain, with contrasting elements of growth and decline.",
