    investorTakeaways: ["**Verify Firmware Integrity:** Always ensure your hardware wallet is running the latest, officially verified firmware, and understand its seed generation process.", "**Due Diligence on Hardware Wallets:** Research the security track record, open-source nature, and audit history of any hardware wallet before entrusting assets.", "**Consider Multi-Signature Setups:** For significant holdings, multi-signature wallets can add an extra layer of security, requiring multiple keys to authorize transactions.", "**Regularly Review Security Practices:** Periodically audit your cold storage setup, backup procedures, and stay informed on potential vulnerabilities.", "**Diversify Storage Methods:** Avoid single points of failure by diversifying asset storage across different secure methods or reputable hardware wallet brands.", "**Stay Informed on Vulnerability Disclosures:** Actively follow news from security researchers and hardware wallet manufacturers for any critical updates or warnings."],
