    featuredImagePrompt: "A conceptual visual representing the dual nature of AI in finance. On one side, a gleaming, upward-trending stock chart or a stylized microchip symbolizing opportunity and growth, perhaps with a subtle overlay of a NASDAQ ticker. On the other side, a fragmented or glitching digital interface, possibly with a broken news headline or a distorted sports score, symbolizing AI errors and risks. A subtle human hand (diverse ethnicity) reaching out to balance these two elements, emphasizing human oversight. Colors should be a blend of optimistic blues/greens for opportunity and cautionary reds/oranges for risk, with a futuristic, digital aesthetic. Avoid literal depictions of specific company logos or people. The composition should be dynamic and thought-provoking.",
