      bearCase: "The cautious stance of traditional Wall Street banks, coupled with the ongoing \'crypto winter\' and its impact on retail platforms like Uphold, suggests that widespread institutional adoption will be slower and more fragmented than anticipated. Persistent regulatory uncertainties and market volatility could continue to deter large-scale capital commitment.",
