      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "A probability-weighted outlook suggests a \'cautiously bullish\' trajectory for institutional crypto integration (60%), with continued short-term challenges for the retail sector (25%) and persistent regulatory and market risks (15%). The overall trend leans towards maturation and professionalization.",
